    "sections": {
        "description": "The Job Recruitment Agency theme provides a modern and organized website structure suitable for displaying recruitment services, staffing information, employment opportunities, and business details. It includes responsive layouts that adapt smoothly across multiple screen sizes and devices for consistent browsing performance. The theme contains customizable homepage sections that help arrange featured jobs, company information, hiring updates, testimonials, and service highlights in a clean manner.Built with lightweight coding practices, the theme supports stable performance, fast loading speed, and easy navigation. Multiple customization settings allow administrators to modify layouts, colors, fonts, and banners according to branding requirements. Integrated blog functionality enables publishing recruitment news, career-related articles, and organizational updates regularly. Additional features such as social media connectivity, contact form compatibility, and structured content sections improve communication and visitor engagement. The overall design focuses on usability, flexibility, and maintaining a professional digital presentation for recruitment and staffing websites."
    },
